            "text": "{\"title\":\"Festive Marrakesh Lamb Tagine with Honeyed Figs and Saffron\",\"readyInMinutes\":105,\"servings\":6,\"summary\":\"This \u003cb\u003ecelebration lamb tagine\u003c/b\u003e is a centerpiece dish created for special Moroccan occasions, holidays, and grand family gatherings. Slow-cooked to absolute perfection, rich cubed lamb shoulder absorbs a fragrant blend of authentic spices including ras el hanout, sweet cinnamon, and luxurious saffron. The addition of tender dried figs and pure wildflower honey creates a classic sweet and savory contrast that defines traditional North African festive cuisine. Crispy toasted blanched almonds are sprinkled over the top just before serving, offering a satisfying textural crunch that complements the velvety sauce and melt-in-your-mouth meat. Every spoonful of this stew delivers a rich tapestry of warm aromas, complex spices, and comforting depth. Traditionally served directly from the clay tagine dish alongside fluffy steamed couscous or warm crusty semolina bread, this impressive recipe is designed to captivate your guests and turn any dinner into a memorable feast. Experience the true heritage of Moroccan hospitality with this lavish stew.\",\"nutrition\":{\"nutrients\":[{\"name\":\"Calories\",\"amount\":620,\"unit\":\"kcal\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":31},{\"name\":\"Fat\",\"amount\":28,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":43},{\"name\":\"Saturated Fat\",\"amount\":8,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":40},{\"name\":\"Carbohydrates\",\"amount\":48,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":16},{\"name\":\"Sugar\",\"amount\":32,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":36},{\"name\":\"Protein\",\"amount\":42,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":84},{\"name\":\"Cholesterol\",\"amount\":110,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":37},{\"name\":\"Sodium\",\"amount\":680,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":28},{\"name\":\"Fiber\",\"amount\":7,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":28},{\"name\":\"Vitami